# Architecture-as-code: the web tier (controllers) must not perform persistence directly —
# it must delegate to a service. An import-graph gate cannot express this (controllers name no
# java.sql; the DB reach is behind Spring Data repository interfaces). candor gates on the EFFECT.
deny Db org.springframework.samples.petclinic.owner.OwnerController
deny Db org.springframework.samples.petclinic.owner.PetController
deny Db org.springframework.samples.petclinic.owner.VisitController
deny Db org.springframework.samples.petclinic.vet.VetController
deny Db org.springframework.samples.petclinic.system.CrashController
